# ==============================================================
#  GrizzlyMedicine / JARVIS — OPEN SOURCE
#
#  This project is published in the open under Kerckhoffs's
#  principle: a defense that only holds when nobody can see it
#  does not actually hold. JARVIS's threat model is the United
#  States Government when it acts in violation of its founding
#  covenant (NSL / FISA §215 / All-Writs / FISA-gag). Publishing
#  the source publicly does not aid that adversary — it already
#  has the capabilities required to compromise closed systems.
#  Publication aids everyone else: independent reviewers, fellow
#  builders, the operator's own patient population, and the
#  historical record. The 1776 covenant was a published document.
#  So is this one.
#
#  Caveat: this README does NOT speak to copyright on every file
#  ever placed in this tree under earlier private-repo assumptions.
#  Maintainers must audit before any release tag.
# ==============================================================

# --- SECRETS: never commit, under any circumstance ---
.env
*.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.blob
secrets/
**/credentials*
**/*api*key*

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
